  "description": "Hae Jin has a father who devoted his whole life to finding the national artifacts that were smuggled out of the country. Then one day, after receiving an unknown “artifact” sent by his father, whom he had lost contact with for a long time, a strange light suddenly came from it, granting Hae Jin a mysterious power and a mission. \n\n*“The magic of the Heavenly Object has been bestowed upon you.”* \n\nThus, an adventure involving the artifacts scattered all over the world, including the \"Three Heavenly Objects,\" which contain the soul of the Korean people, begins! \n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
